members.member:

Helper method to create a SecurityDescriptorEntry domain object from a SecurityDescriptorEntry DTO object and persist it in the db.

A DTO of the SecurityDescriptorEntry
/// SecurityDescriptorEntry

member.summary:
Gets the available valid Users and Groups in the system, and for each task queue, 
Updates and Synchronizes its Users Count and Groups Count based on its Security Descriptor; 
 NOTE: This method will be run only on a need basis, when the DB entries are out of sync.
